IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `masa-advertising-and-labels`

-- Medicines (Advertisement and Sale) Act 1955, ss 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_medicines-advertisement-and-sale-act-1955.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a shop's flyer` MEANS Advertisement WITH
    `published by the Government, a public authority or a public hospital's governing body` IS FALSE
    `published by a person authorised by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `published only so far as reasonably necessary to reach the listed professional classes` IS FALSE
    `published only in a technical publication for health professionals` IS FALSE
    `the accused did not know and had no reason to believe he took part` IS FALSE
    `exempted from section 5 by the Minister's order` IS FALSE

`a Ministry of Health campaign` MEANS Advertisement WITH
    `published by the Government, a public authority or a public hospital's governing body` IS TRUE
    `published by a person authorised by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `published only so far as reasonably necessary to reach the listed professional classes` IS FALSE
    `published only in a technical publication for health professionals` IS FALSE
    `the accused did not know and had no reason to believe he took part` IS FALSE
    `exempted from section 5 by the Minister's order` IS FALSE

`a Minister-authorised advertisement` MEANS Advertisement WITH
    `published by the Government, a public authority or a public hospital's governing body` IS FALSE
    `published by a person authorised by the Minister` IS TRUE
    `published only so far as reasonably necessary to reach the listed professional classes` IS FALSE
    `published only in a technical publication for health professionals` IS FALSE
    `the accused did not know and had no reason to believe he took part` IS FALSE
    `exempted from section 5 by the Minister's order` IS FALSE

`a mailing only to doctors and pharmacists` MEANS Advertisement WITH
    `published by the Government, a public authority or a public hospital's governing body` IS FALSE
    `published by a person authorised by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `published only so far as reasonably necessary to reach the listed professional classes` IS TRUE
    `published only in a technical publication for health professionals` IS FALSE
    `the accused did not know and had no reason to believe he took part` IS FALSE
    `exempted from section 5 by the Minister's order` IS FALSE

`an advertisement in a medical journal` MEANS Advertisement WITH
    `published by the Government, a public authority or a public hospital's governing body` IS FALSE
    `published by a person authorised by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `published only so far as reasonably necessary to reach the listed professional classes` IS FALSE
    `published only in a technical publication for health professionals` IS TRUE
    `the accused did not know and had no reason to believe he took part` IS FALSE
    `exempted from section 5 by the Minister's order` IS FALSE

`an advertisement the printer did not know of` MEANS Advertisement WITH
    `published by the Government, a public authority or a public hospital's governing body` IS FALSE
    `published by a person authorised by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `published only so far as reasonably necessary to reach the listed professional classes` IS FALSE
    `published only in a technical publication for health professionals` IS FALSE
    `the accused did not know and had no reason to believe he took part` IS TRUE
    `exempted from section 5 by the Minister's order` IS FALSE

`an advertisement exempted under section 9` MEANS Advertisement WITH
    `published by the Government, a public authority or a public hospital's governing body` IS FALSE
    `published by a person authorised by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `published only so far as reasonably necessary to reach the listed professional classes` IS FALSE
    `published only in a technical publication for health professionals` IS FALSE
    `the accused did not know and had no reason to believe he took part` IS FALSE
    `exempted from section 5 by the Minister's order` IS TRUE

`an unlabelled cough syrup sold by a pharmacy` MEANS Supply WITH
    `mode` IS `sold by retail`
    `recommended as a medicine` IS TRUE
    `made up and prescribed for a particular person` IS FALSE
    `written in English and clearly legible` IS FALSE
    `designation` IS `no designation`
    `quantitative particulars given` IS FALSE
    `at a shop` IS TRUE
    `contents` IS `a manufactured preparation`

